| info = *Excalibur expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''75''' [[Energy]] to summon javelins against enemies within a radius of {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''15 / 18 / 22 / 25''' meters. Excalibur then drives his weapon into the ground, launching the javelins into their targets. Each javelin inflicts {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''500 / 650 / 800 / 1000''' damage evenly distributed between {{D|Impact}}, {{D|Puncture}}, and {{D|Slash}}, with <u>'''10%'''</u> status chance, a forced {{D|Slash}} Status Effect, and {{D|Stagger}}.
**While javelins do '''not''' [[punch through]] objects or enemies, their striking position is optimized to ensure a successful hit on their targets when they spawn. This allows the javelins to bypass obstacles in the environment including walls, cover, and {{E|Shield Lancer}} shields.
**Radial Javelin will '''not''' target enemies behind obstacles in the environment unless Excalibur has line of sight, or unless the enemy is aware of Excalibur within a short period of time (e.g., an enemy that spots Excalibur and runs out of view can still be targeted by Radial Javelin if the ability is used within a small time frame).
*Each javelin appears as an ethereal {{Weapon|Skana}}. {{WF|Excalibur Prime}} and {{WF|Excalibur Umbra}} javelins appear as ethereal {{Weapon|Skana Prime}}s and "Umbra" Javelins respectively.
*The javelins benefit from [[Universal Weapon Bonuses]], universal critical chance like [[Arcane Avenger]] and universal critical damage like [[tenacious Bond]].
*Has a base 0% critical chance and 1x critical damage.
*When increasing casting speed past ~65%, casting twice in quick succession will cause {{A|Exalted Blade}}'s visual effect to persist for the rest of the mission in Excalibur's hand.
